  "abstract_summary": "Abstract Underwater object detection is challenged by visual degradation such as low contrast, background noise and the difficulty of identifying small targets. To alleviate these issues, we propose UFL-YOLO, an enhanced version of YOLOv10 augmented with lightweight yet effective modules: Small Object Enhance Pyrami...",
